{"id":"8b32674f42e4542b","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-shafarevich.md","title":"Shafarevich Finiteness for Elliptic Curves","display":"df-shafarevich — Shafarevich Finiteness for Elliptic Curves","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-shafarevich","aliases":["58-df-shafarevich"],"display":"df-shafarevich — Shafarevich Finiteness for Elliptic Curves","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-ivc.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-shafarevich"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-shafarevich</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-shafarevich — Shafarevich Finiteness for Elliptic Curves"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"37336284b6cfdfa6\" href=\"?note=37336284b6cfdfa6\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-ivc.md\">../batch01/58-df-ivc.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-shafarevich-—-Shafarevich-Theorem\">df-shafarevich — Shafarevich Theorem</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,S\\in V\">\\(K,S\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NumberField}_S(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{NumberField}_S(K)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Places}(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{Places}(K)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Finite}\">\\(\\operatorname{Finite}\\)</span> (finite-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ShafarevichFiniteness}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ShafarevichFiniteness}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (finiteness predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shafarevich} \\vdash \\mathrm{ShafarevichFiniteness}_S(K,S)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{NumberField}_S(K)\\land S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Places}(K)\\land\\operatorname{Finite}(S)\\land\\operatorname{Finite}\\bigl(\\{E\\in V:\\operatorname{EllipticCurveOver}(E,K)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReductionOutside}(E,S)\\}/{\\cong_K}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shafarevich} \\vdash \\mathrm{ShafarevichFiniteness}_S(K,S)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{NumberField}_S(K)\\land S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Places}(K)\\land\\operatorname{Finite}(S)\\land\\operatorname{Finite}\\bigl(\\{E\\in V:\\operatorname{EllipticCurveOver}(E,K)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReductionOutside}(E,S)\\}/{\\cong_K}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the elliptic-curve Shafarevich finiteness theorem.</li>\n<li>Faltings proved the higher-dimensional generalization for polarized abelian varieties with fixed numerical data.</li>\n<li>Siegel's theorem on integral points is related.</li>\n<li>Places a strong restriction on possible curves over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-shafarevich-—-Shafarevich-Theorem","text":"df-shafarevich — Shafarevich Theorem","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-ivc.md","status":"resolved","id":"37336284b6cfdfa6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-ivc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Finite}$ (finite-set predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{NumberField}_S(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Places}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ShafarevichFiniteness}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}shafarevich} \\vdash \\mathrm{ShafarevichFiniteness}_S(K,S)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{NumberField}_S(K)\\land S\\subseteq\\operatorname{Places}(K)\\land\\operatorname{Finite}(S)\\land\\operatorname{Finite}\\bigl(\\{E\\in V:\\operatorname{EllipticCurveOver}(E,K)\\land\\operatorname{GoodReductionOutside}(E,S)\\}/{\\cong_K}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"K","display":false}],"bytes":1238,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1147","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-shafarevich.md|58-df-shafarevich]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598","37336284b6cfdfa6"]}